Inkling 2 Mini CIRU 512K/1M (NVFP4-KV)

Upstream Inkling 2 Mini model and DSpark draft weights are from Thinking Machines Lab
(https://huggingface.co/thinkingmachines/Inkling-2-Mini).

The runtime overlay includes code from the vLLM project
(https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm). Copyright contributors to the vLLM project.
Ciru modified the NVIDIA runtime for Blackwell and NVFP4 KV caching.
